@import .env.probe
- health=1
```sh
curl -X 'GET' \
  '{{api_base}}/app/healthz' \
  -H 'accept: application/json'
```

- 핀 번호 받기
```sh
curl -X 'GET' \
  '{{api_base}}/app/user/pin?phone={{phone}}' \
  -H 'accept: application/json'
```

- 핀 번호로 토큰 받기
```sh
curl -X 'GET' \
  '{{api_base}}/app/user/pin/validation?pin=9883&phone={{phone}}&unique_device_key=0001' \
  -H 'accept: application/json'
```

- 토큰 디코딩 확인

```sh
curl -X 'GET' \
  '{{api_base}}/app/test/token-decoding?token={{app_token}}' \
  -H 'accept: application/json'
```

- 바코드 생성
```sh
curl -X 'GET' \
  '{{api_base}}/app/user/51758/barcode' \
  -H 'accept: application/json' \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer {{app_token}}'
```

